## ArduinoExtension

**Namespace:** `Cyrena.ArduinoIDE`
**Assembly:** `Cyrena.ArduinoIDE`

### Purpose
Entry point for the `cyrena.arduino_ide` extension. Registers Arduino IDE builder and shortcut.

### Class Definition

```csharp
public class ArduinoExtension : Extension
{
    public override void BuildExtension(CyrenaBuilder builder)
    {
        builder.AddArduinoIDE();
    }
}
```

### Extension Manifest

```json
{
  "id": "cyrena.arduino_ide",
  "name": "Arduino IDE",
  "version": "0.4.0",
  "entryAssemblyFile": "Cyrena.ArduinoIDE.dll",
  "description": "Adds support to develop firmware using Arduino IDE.",
  "dependencies": [
    { "id": "cyrena.developer", "minVersion": "0.4.0" },
    { "id": "cyrena.api_references", "minVersion": "0.4.0" }
  ],
  "requireFrameworkBuilder": true
}
```

### Registration
```csharp
public static CyrenaBuilder AddArduinoIDE(this CyrenaBuilder builder)
{
    builder.Services.AddSingleton<ICodeBuilder, ArduinoIDECodeBuilder>();
    builder.AddShortcut<ArduinoShortcut>();
    return builder;
}
```
